<view class="intro-page">
  <view class="intro-hero">
    <image class="intro-hero-image" src="/assets/inn-intro/entrance.webp" mode="aspectFill" aria-label="芊浔民宿门头实拍" />
    <view class="intro-hero-wash"></view>
    <view class="intro-hero-copy">
      <text class="intro-eyebrow">MISTVILLA · NANXUN</text>
      <text class="intro-brand">芊浔民宿</text>
      <text class="intro-tagline">枕水而居 · 慢游南浔</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="intro-content">
    <view class="intro-story card">
      <text class="story-title">宝善街上的一座小院</text>
      <text class="story-body">芊浔民宿坐落于南浔古镇宝善街，邻近百间楼。从沿河老街回来，推开木门，就能在庭院里坐一会儿。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="section-block">
      <text class="section-title">民宿庭院</text>
      <view class="courtyard-card card">
        <image class="courtyard-image" src="/assets/inn-intro/courtyard.webp" mode="widthFix" lazy-load="{{true}}" aria-label="民宿公共庭院实拍" />
        <text class="courtyard-caption">院里有遮阳伞和桌椅，逛完古镇可以回来歇歇脚。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-block">
      <text class="section-title">入住服务</text>
      <view class="feature-grid">
        <view class="feature-card">
          <view class="feature-icon"><qx-icon name="landmark" size="34" /></view>
          <text class="feature-title">免费停车</text>
          <text class="feature-caption">自驾出行更从容</text>
        </view>
        <view class="feature-card">
          <view class="feature-icon"><qx-icon name="sparkles-celadon" size="34" /></view>
          <text class="feature-title">智能客控</text>
          <text class="feature-caption">客房体验更便捷</text>
        </view>
        <view class="feature-card">
          <view class="feature-icon"><qx-icon name="sprout" size="34" /></view>
          <text class="feature-title">宠物友好</text>
          <text class="feature-caption">携宠入住请先联系</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-block">
      <text class="section-title">周边可逛</text>
      <view class="walk-card">
        <text class="walk-body">从宝善街出发，可沿河逛百间楼，再到东大街和张静江故居。</text>
        <view class="walk-sites">
          <text class="site-chip">百间楼</text>
          <text class="site-chip">张静江故居</text>
          <text class="site-chip">东大街</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-block">
      <text class="section-title">到店指引</text>
      <view class="location-card">
        <view class="location-topline">
          <view class="location-pin"><qx-icon name="map-pin" size="34" /></view>
          <text class="location-label">民宿地址</text>
        </view>
        <text class="location-address">{{address}}</text>
        <text class="location-transit">可复制地址到地图查询路线。自驾到店可先联系民宿确认停车位置。</text>
        <view class="location-actions">
          <button class="location-action location-copy" bindtap="onAddressTap">复制地址</button>
          <button class="location-action location-call" bindtap="onCallTap">联系民宿</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

  </view>

  <view class="intro-bottom-bar">
    <text class="bottom-hint">选好日期，看看哪间客房适合你</text>
    <button class="rooms-button" hover-class="rooms-button-hover" bindtap="onViewRoomsTap">查看客房</button>
  </view>
</view>
